<html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
<head>
<title>a nested ul marks with circle, the next level with square</title>
<meta name="assert" content="HTML 15.3.8: ul ul { list-style-type: circle }, ul ul ul { list-style-type: square }; nested lists have no vertical margins."/>
</head>
<body><ul><li>one<ul><li>two<ul><li>three</li></ul></li></ul></li></ul>
</body>
</html>
